              "top": 17.830436197916665,
              "bottom": 34.333821614583336
            },
            {
              "text": "Use the calendar and scales to compare crops and plan their care.",
              "left": 16.999479166666664,
              "right": 138.00087890625,
              "top": 36.33059895833333,
              "bottom": 40.77477213541666
            },
            {
              "text": "Reading the calendar",
