              "right": 176.99798177083332,
              "top": 43.77200520833333,
              "bottom": 50.341113281249996
            },
            {
              "text": "Bright shades show the usual sowing and harvest months for temperate climates: here, lowland England (US zones 8 to 9). Muted shades show less usual options for warmer climates. Use local conditions and the crop’s advice to choose your timing.",
